#. type: Plain text
#: text/upstream/general.ent:231
msgid ""
"<!ENTITY github-lfs-fork \"<note><para>On GitHub we've forked the "
"upstream repository into our own <literal>lfs-book</literal> "
"namespace and recreated a tag for the release.  This is done to "
"ensure the downloaded tarball file name to be correct and consistent "
"(i.e. it shouldn't change when using the browser instead of a tool "
"like <command>wget</command>).  Our tag and the upstream release tag "
"are on the same commit, so we've not introduced any change to the "
"tarball content except the name of its top-level directory (that Git "
"does not track).</para></note>\">"
msgstr ""
